 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity**: Parameter validation runs in $O(1)$ time [S2, unofficial]. The computational cost lies in downstream [Volumetric Cloud Raymarching](1248-volumetric-cloud-raymarching.md) and noise generation, which scale with `max_render_distance` and `quality` settings [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Memory Complexity**: Memory complexity is $O(1)$ for the configuration structure itself, while actual volume data memory depends on `resolution` (Scheme B) or texture size (Scheme A) [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial].
+*   **Time Complexity**: Not given in the sources.
+*   **Memory Complexity**: Not given in the sources.
 *   **Strengths**: Centralized control over cloud physics and visuals, and decoupling parameter definition from rendering logic [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial].
 *   **Limitations**: Requires careful tuning of noise scales and wind vectors, and Scheme B has rigid resolution choices [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial].
